## Dry Hire or Full Service?

Not every corporate event needs a technician on site. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) and [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) are delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then run by you or your own team. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes a technician on site for up to six hours, so a dropped microphone connection or a projector that will not sync gets fixed immediately.

## Booking and Service Area

