## FAQs

### What AV equipment do I need for a corporate event?

It depends on the event type. A product launch needs a sound system, a wireless microphone and a projector, which the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) covers. A board meeting or small conference benefits from a gooseneck microphone and projector, which the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) covers. A larger conference benefits from a bigger screen and a technician, which the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) covers.

### How much does audio visual rental cost for a corporate event?

Pricing depends on the package: our full catalog, from the Product Presentation Pack up to the MICE Pack for a full conference, is listed with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### Do I need an on-site technician, or can I set up the equipment myself?

It depends on the package. The Product Presentation Pack and Basic MICE Pack are delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then run by you. The MICE Pack includes a technician on site for up to six hours. See [Dry Hire or Full Service?](#dry-hire-or-full-service) above.

### What size event does each package support?

The Basic MICE Pack covers up to 40 guests, and the MICE Pack covers up to 120. The Product Presentation Pack is sized for a presentation rather than a guest count. See [Match Your Event to a Package](#match-your-event-to-a-package) above.

### Is it better to rent locally or use a hotel's in-house AV provider?

A local provider gives you transparent, itemized pricing and equipment you can see before you book, rather than a bundled hotel AV quote. We deliver, install and test the equipment ourselves at your chosen venue, whether that is a hotel, an office or another venue across Malaga and the Costa del Sol.

### What kind of microphones are included for a corporate presentation or panel?

It depends on the package: a gooseneck microphone for a podium or panel on the Basic MICE Pack, or a gooseneck plus wireless handheld microphone on the MICE Pack for a speaker who moves between the podium and the audience.

### How far in advance should I book AV equipment for a corporate event?

Book as early as you can once your date and venue are confirmed. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros, and we recommend booking at least 24 hours in advance.
